    "content" : "2 -dimensional Hausdorff measure in R\uD835\uDC5B(\uD835\uDC5B−1)/2 is denoted by \uD835\uDC49\uD835\uDF06,\uD835\uDF07, while that of pGT(\uD835\uDF06, \uD835\uDF07) with respect to the Lebesgue measure on R(\uD835\uDC5B−1)(\uD835\uDC5B−2)/2 is denoted by \uD835\uDC49˜\uD835\uDF06,\uD835\uDF07. It is then a simple consequence of the area formula [Fed96, Theorem 3.2.3] that"
